{"type":"tool_end","payload":{"toolCallId":"toolu_01QKXmJRYckjgAR4KpK3aZeo","result":"<file path=\"artifacts/inputs/documentation/epics.md\" lines=\"180\" start=\"1\" end=\"179\" returned=\"179\" has_more=\"true\" truncated=\"false\">\n     1|# InsideFIFA-WEB Epics Document\n     2|\n     3|## Epic Overview\n     4|**Project:** InsideFIFA-WEB  \n     5|**Version:** 1.0.0  \n     6|**Date:** 2026-08-21  \n     7|\n     8|## Epic List\n     9|\n    10|### EPIC-001: Core Navigation Framework\n    11|**Title:** Core Navigation Test Framework  \n    12|**Priority Tier:** Must Have  \n    13|**Complexity:** High  \n    14|**Description:** Establish the foundational test automation framework for website navigation testing  \n    15|\n    16|**Mapped FRs:** [FR-001, FR-005]  \n    17|**Dependencies:** None  \n    18|**Acceptance Criteria:**\n    19|- Test framework setup complete\n    20|- Chrome browser integration working\n    21|- Basic page object model implemented\n    22|- Test reporting mechanism functional\n    23|\n    24|---\n    25|\n    26|### EPIC-002: Homepage Validation\n    27|**Title:** Homepage Functionality and Navigation Validation  \n    28|**Priority Tier:** Must Have  \n    29|**Complexity:** Medium  \n    30|**Description:** Comprehensive testing of the FIFA homepage navigation and core functionality  \n    31|\n    32|**Mapped FRs:** [FR-001]  \n    33|**Dependencies:** EPIC-001  \n    34|**Acceptance Criteria:**\n    35|- Homepage loads successfully\n    36|- All primary navigation elements functional\n    37|- Performance metrics captured\n    38|- Visual validation of key elements\n    39|\n    40|---\n    41|\n    42|### EPIC-003: \"What FIFA Does\" Content Areas\n    43|**Title:** \"What FIFA Does\" Subpages Navigation Testing  \n    44|**Priority Tier:** Must Have  \n    45|**Complexity:** Medium  \n    46|**Description:** Validate navigation and content display for all \"What FIFA does\" topic areas  \n    47|\n    48|**Mapped FRs:** [FR-002]  \n    49|**Dependencies:** EPIC-001, EPIC-002  \n    50|**Acceptance Criteria:**\n    51|- All 7 topic pages accessible\n    52|- Content loads correctly on each page\n    53|- Navigation between topics functional\n    54|- Page-specific elements validated\n    55|\n    56|---\n    57|\n    58|### EPIC-004: Top Navigation Menu Testing\n    59|**Title:** Top Navigation \"Inside FIFA\" Menu Validation  \n    60|**Priority Tier:** Must Have  \n    61|**Complexity:** Medium  \n    62|**Description:** Test the top navigation bar \"Inside FIFA\" button and all sub-menu items  \n    63|\n    64|**Mapped FRs:** [FR-003]  \n    65|**Dependencies:** EPIC-001  \n    66|**Acceptance Criteria:**\n    67|- \"Inside FIFA\" button accessible\n    68|- All sub-items discovered and testable\n    69|- Dropdown/click functionality working\n    70|- Sub-item navigation validated\n    71|\n    72|---\n    73|\n    74|### EPIC-005: Multi-language Framework Support\n    75|**Title:** Multi-language Testing Capability  \n    76|**Priority Tier:** Should Have  \n    77|**Complexity:** High  \n    78|**Description:** Extend framework to support testing across multiple languages (EN, ES, FR)  \n    79|\n    80|**Mapped FRs:** [FR-004]  \n    81|**Dependencies:** EPIC-001, EPIC-002, EPIC-003, EPIC-004  \n    82|**Acceptance Criteria:**\n    83|- Language switching mechanism implemented\n    84|- English version fully tested\n    85|- Spanish and French versions testable\n    86|- Language-specific selectors managed\n    87|\n    88|---\n    89|\n    90|### EPIC-006: Cross-browser Expansion\n    91|**Title:** Cross-browser Testing Extension  \n    92|**Priority Tier:** Could Have  \n    93|**Complexity:** High  \n    94|**Description:** Extend test coverage to additional browsers beyond Chrome  \n    95|\n    96|**Mapped FRs:** [FR-005]  \n    97|**Dependencies:** EPIC-001  \n    98|**Acceptance Criteria:**\n    99|- Framework architecture supports multiple browsers\n   100|- Firefox integration implemented\n   101|- Safari integration implemented  \n   102|- Edge integration implemented\n   103|- Browser-specific configurations externalized\n   104|\n   105|---\n   106|\n   107|### EPIC-007: Responsive Design Testing\n   108|**Title:** Multi-viewport Testing Support  \n   109|**Priority Tier:** Could Have  \n   110|**Complexity:** Medium  \n   111|**Description:** Add support for testing different screen sizes and breakpoints  \n   112|\n   113|**Mapped FRs:** [FR-005]  \n   114|**Dependencies:** EPIC-006  \n   115|**Acceptance Criteria:**\n   116|- Mobile viewport testing (375px width)\n   117|- Tablet viewport testing (768px width)\n   118|- Large desktop viewport testing (1440px width)\n   119|- Responsive element validation\n   120|\n   121|---\n   122|\n   123|## Enablers\n   124|\n   125|### ENABLER-001: Test Infrastructure Setup\n   126|**Description:** Establish CI/CD pipeline integration and test execution environment  \n   127|**Epic Dependencies:** EPIC-001  \n   128|\n   129|### ENABLER-002: Test Data Management\n   130|**Description:** Create test data management system for multi-language content validation  \n   131|**Epic Dependencies:** EPIC-005  \n   132|\n   133|### ENABLER-003: Reporting Dashboard\n   134|**Description:** Implement comprehensive test reporting and metrics dashboard  \n   135|**Epic Dependencies:** All epics  \n   136|\n   137|## Spikes\n   138|\n   139|### SPIKE-001: Selector Strategy Research\n   140|**Description:** Research optimal selector strategies for dynamic FIFA website content  \n   141|**Epic Dependencies:** EPIC-001  \n   142|**Duration:** 2 days  \n   143|\n   144|### SPIKE-002: Performance Testing Integration\n   145|**Description:** Investigate performance testing tools integration with navigation tests  \n   146|**Epic Dependencies:** EPIC-002  \n   147|**Duration:** 3 days  \n   148|\n   149|### SPIKE-003: Visual Testing Framework\n   150|**Description:** Evaluate visual regression testing tools for UI validation  \n   151|**Epic Dependencies:** EPIC-007  \n   152|**Duration:** 2 days  \n   153|\n   154|## Epic Dependencies Matrix\n   155|\n   156|| Epic | Depends On |\n   157||------|------------|\n   158|| EPIC-001 | None |\n   159|| EPIC-002 | EPIC-001 |\n   160|| EPIC-003 | EPIC-001, EPIC-002 |\n   161|| EPIC-004 | EPIC-001 |\n   162|| EPIC-005 | EPIC-001, EPIC-002, EPIC-003, EPIC-004 |\n   163|| EPIC-006 | EPIC-001 |\n   164|| EPIC-007 | EPIC-006 |\n   165|\n   166|## Priority Distribution\n   167|\n   168|| Priority Tier | Epic Count | Epics |\n   169||--------------|------------|-------|\n   170|| Must Have | 4 | EPIC-001, EPIC-002, EPIC-003, EPIC-004 |\n   171|| Should Have | 1 | EPIC-005 |\n   172|| Could Have | 2 | EPIC-006, EPIC-007 |\n   173|\n   174|## Complexity Distribution\n   175|\n   176|| Complexity | Epic Count | Epics |\n   177||------------|------------|-------|\n   178|| High | 3 | EPIC-001, EPIC-005, EPIC-006 |\n   179|| Medium | 4 | EPIC-002, EPIC-003, EPIC-004, EPIC-007 |\n</file>","isError":false}}
