{"type":"tool_end","payload":{"toolCallId":"toolu_01AEnsqJoGJZtLL7dBPq4AWB","result":"<file path=\"artifacts/inputs/documentation/adrs/ADR-SPEC.md\" lines=\"55\" start=\"1\" end=\"54\" returned=\"54\" has_more=\"true\" truncated=\"false\">\n     1|# ADR Specification - InsideFIFA-WEB\n     2|\n     3|## Architecture Decision Records Catalog\n     4|\n     5|### ADR-001: Test Framework Selection\n     6|**Title:** Playwright as Primary Test Automation Framework  \n     7|**Category:** Technology Selection  \n     8|**Status:** Accepted  \n     9|**Date:** 2026-08-21  \n    10|**Decision Summary:** Selected Playwright for web automation due to cross-browser support, modern API, and excellent performance  \n    11|**Technology:** Playwright v1.40+  \n    12|\n    13|### ADR-002: Page Object Model Pattern\n    14|**Title:** Implementation of Page Object Model (POM) Design Pattern  \n    15|**Category:** Architecture  \n    16|**Status:** Accepted  \n    17|**Date:** 2026-08-21  \n    18|**Decision Summary:** Adopt POM pattern for maintainable test code and separation of concerns  \n    19|**Technology:** TypeScript with POM pattern  \n    20|\n    21|### ADR-003: Test Data Management Strategy\n    22|**Title:** Externalized Test Data Configuration  \n    23|**Category:** Data Management  \n    24|**Status:** Accepted  \n    25|**Date:** 2026-08-21  \n    26|**Decision Summary:** Use JSON configuration files for test data to support multi-language testing  \n    27|**Technology:** JSON configuration with environment-specific files  \n    28|\n    29|### ADR-004: Reporting Strategy\n    30|**Title:** HTML Test Reports with Screenshots  \n    31|**Category:** Reporting  \n    32|**Status:** Accepted  \n    33|**Date:** 2026-08-21  \n    34|**Decision Summary:** Implement Playwright HTML Reporter with screenshot capture on failures  \n    35|**Technology:** Playwright HTML Reporter  \n    36|\n    37|## Technology Stack Matrix\n    38|\n    39|| Layer | Technology | Version | Purpose |\n    40||-------|------------|---------|---------|\n    41|| Test Framework | Playwright | 1.40+ | Web automation |\n    42|| Language | TypeScript | 5.0+ | Type-safe development |\n    43|| Build Tool | npm | 10.0+ | Package management |\n    44|| Test Runner | Playwright Test | 1.40+ | Test execution |\n    45|| Reporting | Playwright HTML | 1.40+ | Test results |\n    46|| Configuration | JSON | - | Test data management |\n    47|\n    48|## Impact Matrix\n    49|\n    50|| ADR | Impact Area | Risk Level | Mitigation |\n    51||-----|-------------|------------|------------|\n    52|| ADR-001 | Framework Selection | Low | Proven technology with good community support |\n    53|| ADR-002 | Code Architecture | Low | Industry standard pattern |\n    54|| ADR-003 | Data Management | Medium | Requires careful data maintenance |\n</file>","isError":false}}
