{"type":"tool_end","payload":{"toolCallId":"toolu_01KoyTzwQg2fEzJebS22vThM","result":"<file path=\"./context-pack/system/execution-protocol/04-memory-bank.md\" lines=\"250\" start=\"1\" end=\"150\" returned=\"150\" has_more=\"true\" truncated=\"false\">\n     1|> **Execution Protocol section file — §4 Memory Bank.** Routing + universal sections (§2, §10.5, §11) live in [`execution-protocol.md`](../execution-protocol.md). § numbering is preserved.\n     2|\n     3|## 4. Memory Bank — Cross-Session Continuity\n     4|\n     5|Two files in `./context-pack/` provide every session's agent with immediate context\n     6|about what happened before — without re-reading all prior session artifacts.\n     7|\n     8|```\n     9|context-pack/\n    10|├── active-context.md    ← \"What is happening NOW?\" (overwritten each session)\n    11|└── progress.md          ← \"What HAS been accomplished?\" (append-only ledger)\n    12|```\n    13|\n    14|Both live at the **project root** `./context-pack/` — shared across all capabilities\n    15|so `progress.md` becomes a unified cross-capability timeline.\n    16|\n    17|### RULE 10 — active-context.md (Session Lifecycle)\n    18|\n    19|At SESSION START: write `context-pack/active-context.md` with current session ID,\n    20|scope, and any prior session context loaded above. Status: `STARTING`.\n    21|At SESSION END: overwrite with final state (status, decisions, blockers, key artifacts).\n    22|If the session crashes before finalization, the SESSION START write provides\n    23|\"where we were\" context for the next session.\n    24|\n    25|### RULE 11 — progress.md (Per-Phase Milestone Ledger)\n    26|\n    27|After EVERY phase completes (NOT just the final phase): append one milestone row to\n    28|`context-pack/progress.md` (append-only — never overwrite, never delete prior rows).\n    29|Writing IMPL-STATE does NOT satisfy this write — they are different files with different\n    30|scopes. Skipping an intermediate phase write breaks per-phase crash recovery.\n    31|\n    32|### Session Start\n    33|\n    34|```\n    35|CONTEXT_PACK_PATH = ./context-pack\n    36|\n    37|IF exists({CONTEXT_PACK_PATH}/active-context.md):\n    38|  READ active-context.md\n    39|  EXTRACT: prior_session_id, status, current_focus, open_blockers, decisions_log\n    40|  LOG: \"Memory Bank: loaded active-context from session {prior_session_id}\"\n    41|  # Use to: avoid re-discovering known blockers, continue from prior state,\n    42|  #         respect decisions already made (do not contradict them)\n    43|ELSE:\n    44|  LOG: \"Memory Bank: No active-context.md found. First session.\"\n    45|\n    46|IF exists({CONTEXT_PACK_PATH}/progress.md):\n    47|  READ progress.md\n    48|  EXTRACT: milestone_count, last_milestone\n    49|ELSE:\n    50|  LOG: \"Memory Bank: No progress.md found. First session.\"\n    51|\n    52|# Write active-context.md at session START (crash recovery — mandatory)\n    53|WRITE {CONTEXT_PACK_PATH}/active-context.md:\n    54|  ---\n    55|  document_type: active-context\n    56|  session_id: {SESSION_ID}\n    57|  capability: {capability_name}\n    58|  skill: {skill_name}\n    59|  project: {project_name}\n    60|  last_updated: {ISO timestamp}\n    61|  status: STARTING\n    62|  ---\n    63|  # Active Context: {project_name}\n    64|  ## Current Focus\n    65|  Session {SESSION_ID} initializing. Skill: {skill_name}. Mode: {BUILD | REPAIR}.\n    66|  ## Prior Session Context\n    67|  {IF prior loaded: Previous: {prior_session_id} — status: {prior_status}. Include blockers/decisions.}\n    68|  {ELSE: First session — no prior context.}\n    69|  ## Open Blockers\n    70|  {Copy from prior session if any, else \"None.\"}\n    71|```\n    72|\n    73|### Session End\n    74|\n    75|```\n    76|# 1. Overwrite active-context.md with final state\n    77|WRITE {CONTEXT_PACK_PATH}/active-context.md:\n    78|  ---\n    79|  status: {COMPLETED | FAILED | BLOCKED}\n    80|  session_id: {SESSION_ID}\n    81|  last_updated: {ISO timestamp}\n    82|  ---\n    83|  # Active Context: {project_name}\n    84|  ## Current Focus\n    85|  {COMPLETED: \"{skill_name} complete. Produced: {artifact summary with counts}.\"}\n    86|  {FAILED: \"{skill_name} failed. Reason: {description}.\"}\n    87|  {BLOCKED: \"{skill_name} blocked. Blocker: {description}. Required: {resolution}.\"}\n    88|  ## Decisions Log\n    89|  Append-only within a session. Preserve ALL rows from prior sessions.\n    90|  | ID | Decision | Rationale | Impact | Reversible | Session |\n    91|  |----|----------|-----------|--------|------------|---------|\n    92|  {Carry forward all prior rows. Append new decisions from this session.}\n    93|  {ID format: D-{NNN}, sequential across sessions, never reset.}\n    94|  {If no new decisions: keep prior rows, add nothing.}\n    95|  ## Open Blockers\n    96|  {Unresolved issues, or \"No open blockers.\"}\n    97|  ## Key Artifacts\n    98|  | Artifact | Path | Status |\n    99|  |----------|------|--------|\n   100|  | {primary output} | {path} | written |\n   101|\n   102|# 2. Append milestone to progress.md\n   103|IF NOT exists({CONTEXT_PACK_PATH}/progress.md):\n   104|  CREATE with header:\n   105|    ---\n   106|    document_type: progress-ledger\n   107|    project: {project_name}\n   108|    created_at: {ISO timestamp}\n   109|    ---\n   110|    # Progress Ledger: {project_name}\n   111|    | Session | Date | Capability | Skill | Status | Artifacts | Notes |\n   112|    |---------|------|------------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n   113|\n   114|APPEND one row:\n   115|  | {SESSION_ID} | {date} | {capability} | {skill_name} | {STATUS} | {N <artifact-type>} | {1-line note} |\n   116|  # {N <artifact-type>} MUST use the specific type from the registry below.\n   117|  # Examples: \"12 tasks (4 phases)\", \"48 files, 32 tests\", \"17 review-findings\"\n   118|  # NEVER write: \"1 artifact\", \"N artifacts\", or leave blank